<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "イエローカメラ.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\喫茶店中1.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ母.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>"<STYLE ID="1">Mifuyu</STYLE>... what happened after that? I heard <STYLE ID="2">Eiichiro-san</STYLE> took to his bed."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Eiichiro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> and I had met the day before, and now I was meeting </STYLE>Akane<STYLE ID="3"> at the usual cafe.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Uugh... </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Eiichiro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">In the end, I couldn't ask for </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Eiichiro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">'s contact info, and I couldn't go after him either.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Right away I set up a meeting with </STYLE>Akane<STYLE ID="3">.</STYLE><PG>
"So... <STYLE ID="2">Eiichiro-san</STYLE>'s a no after all?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"N-no, that's not it! </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">He</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s just like me... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">So I understand how </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Eiichiro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> feels way too well, so much it hurts..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"And that's why he took to his bed... what's that supposed to mean?"<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">―I told </STYLE>Akane<STYLE ID="3"> what </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Eiichiro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> and I had talked about in Central Park.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\喫茶店中1.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ母腕組み.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"I see... Two of a kind, so you'd think you'd get along, but you're too much alike, so neither of you can make a move..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Uugh... what should I do..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"What are you talking about? You charge in! 
{PAUSE ""}
　Ch-
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
ar-
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
g-
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
e!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"What's that..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Go see <STYLE ID="2">Eiichiro-san</STYLE>, who's laid up in bed, right now!"<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"What?!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"He took to his bed out of self-loathing, because he thinks he's no match for you, <STYLE ID="1">Mifuyu</STYLE>, right? 
{PAUSE ""}
　Then go there yourself and talk to <STYLE ID="2">Eiichiro-san</STYLE> properly. 
{PAUSE ""}
Or do you have some complaint about <STYLE ID="4">Eiichiro-san</STYLE>?"<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Uugh... no complaints... if anything, I thought he was really nice... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">But what should I even talk about..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"<STYLE ID="1">You</STYLE>, honestly..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Would he really like someone like me..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ母.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Ugh, enough! Come on! We're going!"<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\sei_ge_cowbell01.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">―Dragged along by </STYLE>Akane<STYLE ID="3"> against my will, I headed to the apartment building where </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Eiichiro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> lived.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\quiet-residential-area1.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "900" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\栄一郎マンション.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ母腕組み.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"<STYLE ID="2">Eiichiro-san</STYLE> lives in 502, apparently."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Uugh... </STYLE>Akane<STYLE ID="1">, come with me..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Haah... Only as far as the door, okay?"<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\エレベーター.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "500" "1000" "PASS"}
{MESON "500"}
Akane<STYLE ID="3"> brought me as far as the door of room 502, and </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{PLAYSND "SE\インターホン.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "800" "0"}
<STYLE ID="3">without even waiting for me to get ready, she rang the intercom.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\栄一郎マンション外廊下.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ母腕組み.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"No answer..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"He must be out! Come on, let's go home, okay?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ母.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Oh, it's open..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Akane<STYLE ID="3"> had opened the door without asking anyone.</STYLE><PG>
"Well then, good luck in there!"
{PLAYSND "SE\軽くぶつかる.ogg" "VOICE" "WAIT" "1000" "0"}
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Whoa!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{STOPSND "SE" "1000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\iron_door1_C.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
Akane<STYLE ID="3"> shoved me into the room by force.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Uugh... what do I do..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">Inside, the curtains were closed and it was dim.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Eiichiro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, are you here?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">I tried calling in a small voice he surely couldn't hear.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Of course, there was no answer.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">I took off my shoes and slowly went inside.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\栄一郎布団暗い.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">Inside, it was tidy, with a little of a lived-in feel left.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">A futon was laid out, and I could see someone sleeping under the comforter.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Um... </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Eiichiro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">I went up to the futon and called to him.</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "ごろごろゲームする日_2.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Mifuyu-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">'s voice... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">I'm finally hearing things... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">It's terminal..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">That voice was definitely </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Eiichiro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">'s.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Eiichiro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">'s nonsensical words reached my ears.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Um... </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Eiichiro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">? It's Mifuyu..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">The moment I called to him again, </STYLE>
{PLAYSND "SE\布団.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="3">the comforter flew up so high it nearly hit the ceiling.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Whoa!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"M-M-M-</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Mifuyu-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">?!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\スイッチ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\栄一郎布団.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="3">In his startled jump he hit the light switch with his back, revealing </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Eiichiro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> in nothing but his underwear.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\栄一郎足.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Mifuyu-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, why?! Ah, the way I'm dressed, this is, um...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"U-um, uh...! I heard you were sick in bed, so I was worried...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">The light's pull cord swung as if it were laughing at this whole exchange.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">We were both so flustered that it took a while for </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Eiichiro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> to get his clothes on.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\栄一郎布団.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\栄一郎バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"I-I-I'm sorry for barging in all of a sudden! A-a-are you all right?!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Uh-uh-uh-um, I-I-I'm all right!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">We were both so jittery that we couldn't hold a conversation.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Eiichiro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, h-h-have you eaten properly?!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"N-n-not yet today...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Th-then I'll m-make something!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\室内早歩き.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="3">Carried by the momentum, I headed for the kitchen.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\栄一郎台所.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Uugh... </STYLE>Akane<STYLE ID="1">, what do I do..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">I'd ended up making him a meal, but could I make anything that would suit </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Eiichiro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">'s taste...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">I cleared the sink as best I could and checked inside the fridge.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">There were a fair number of ingredients, but I didn't want to keep him waiting long, so I couldn't make anything that took time.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">When I stole a glance at </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Eiichiro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">...</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\栄一郎布団.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\栄一郎うつむき.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">He was kneeling formally with his head down, looking restless.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Like this, the silence would be too much for him, so something quick to make and filling...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">That meant...</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\千切り.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\鉄板で焼く.ogg" "VOICE2" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{STOPSND "VOICE2" "2000" "WAIT"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">15 minutes later, I brought the finished dish over to </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Eiichiro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "イエローカメラ.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\皿を置く.ogg" "VOICE" "WAIT" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\お好み焼き.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Um, I hope it suits your taste..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">What I'd made was okonomiyaki. [TN: A savory pan-fried pancake of batter and cabbage.]</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Making something quickly with whatever was on hand, this was about all I could manage.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"It looks... so delicious... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">I-is it really okay for me to eat this?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Y-yes! I took the liberty of making it for you, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Eiichiro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　Um, I don't think it tastes bad, but..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Eiichiro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> slowly brought his chopsticks to the okonomiyaki and put a bite of it in his mouth.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"How is it...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Eiichiro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> stayed silent.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Then, still silent, he put another bite in his mouth.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">Eiichiro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">'s movements were slow, yet the okonomiyaki was vanishing at an amazing speed.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">I watched him, heart pounding, like a student waiting for exam results.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Eventually, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Eiichiro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> finished the okonomiyaki and stared at the empty plate for a while.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\栄一郎布団.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\栄一郎うつむき.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Um... did it suit your taste...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Uh... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">ungh... hic..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Eiichiro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> suddenly let out that groaning cry of his.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">I had never expected him to cry.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"For me... </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Mifuyu-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">It's really delicious... I'm so happy I could die..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Really?! I'm so glad...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Uuuh..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Eiichiro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> started crying again.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">What should I do in a case like this?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Eiichiro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> thinks the same way I do.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">In that case, maybe I should do for him what I'd want done for me.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"U-um! I heard you'd been in bed all day, so would you like to go for a walk? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　I'm sure walking around outside will make you feel better!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">That line was something </STYLE>Akane<STYLE ID="3"> would say to me.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">But </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Eiichiro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> frowned.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\栄一郎頭かく.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"But... wouldn't you be embarrassed, walking with a guy like me?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Huh?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"I mean... look at me..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"............ </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Pff! Ahahaha!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">It was just like a conversation between me and </STYLE>Akane<STYLE ID="3">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Now I understood well how </STYLE>Akane<STYLE ID="3"> had felt, dealing with me.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Eiichiro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">'s feelings when he said something like that, I understood well too.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"I want to walk with you, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Eiichiro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">If I'm good enough for you... together..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">And </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Eiichiro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">'s face turned as red as coal.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\栄一郎バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Y-yes! I'll go! If I'll do, I'll be your attendant!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Heh... 'attendant'... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">ahahaha!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Ha... hahaha!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">It was the first moment that </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Eiichiro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> and I laughed together.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">Just as I'd thought, if I got cheerful, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Eiichiro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> could get cheerful too.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Eiichiro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">'s smile made me happy as well.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">At that moment, I felt it clearly:</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Eiichiro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> had my heartfelt affection.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\夕焼け.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "5000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">Today again, a November wind was blowing that made you feel winter.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Side by side, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Eiichiro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> and I walked through the early-winter sunset.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Eiichiro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">'s face was bright red, as always.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">He seemed to be searching desperately for something to talk about, with a face that was shaky but earnest.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">Eiichiro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> was dragging one leg as he walked, just like when we'd parted yesterday.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Surely the alcohol was out of his system by now, so it really was because of an old injury.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\手をつなぐ.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">Then, without warning, our hands bumped for an instant.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Whoa-whoa! I'm sorry!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"No, I'm the one who did something improper...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">With frozen faces, we stared at each other for a while.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Heh..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Hahaha..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Eiichiro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">'s hand had been warm.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Maybe because of that, the winter wind suddenly began to feel cold.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"It's a little chilly... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">There's a cafe I always go to with </STYLE>Akane<STYLE ID="1">. Would you like to stop by?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Y-yes! As long as I'm with you, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Mifuyu-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, anywhere!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
