{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">Come to think of it, this was the first time I'd come into this cafe with anyone besides </STYLE>Akane<STYLE ID="3">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Maybe because today was especially cold, it was more crowded than when I'd come in with </STYLE>Akane<STYLE ID="3"> earlier.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">I could hear people around us whispering.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Are they a couple, you think..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"It's like </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Beauty</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> and the </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Beast</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Maybe the </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">guy</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">'s super rich or something?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Even if he was rich, those looks would be a bit much for me... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Yeah, he must be that good of a person."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\栄一郎うつむき.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Uuuh... I knew it, I'm..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Eiichiro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> hunched his back.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I'm happy to be with you, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Eiichiro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">I gave </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Eiichiro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> a big smile.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\栄一郎頭かく.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Um... me too, being with you, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Mifuyu-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">makes me happy!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Until a moment ago I'd been nervous too, but that feeling was completely gone.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">More than that, I was happy just to be with </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Eiichiro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">Oh no! The only drink this place had was coffee!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Eiichiro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> had said he couldn't do coffee either, hadn't he...</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Welcome, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Kanai-sama</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">. What would you like to order?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">The usual server came to take our order.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Then </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Eiichiro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> raised his voice louder than ever.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\栄一郎バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Ex-excushe me! Me and </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Mifuyu-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, we're both no good with coffee! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　Do you have anyshing even we can drink?!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">The moment he shouted that, the customers around us all burst out laughing at once.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Pfffff...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"D-don't! You can't laugh!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">I'd meant not to let it bother me, but even I got annoyed at the people around us.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">But it's fine. As long as I know </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Eiichiro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">'s charms, that's enough.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Yes, we do. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">The owner here was originally someone who disliked coffee as well, so we have put </STYLE><STYLE ID="7" RUBY="そろ">together</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> a menu that even such guests can enjoy. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">I shall prepare that for you, then."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">What?! There was some kind of secret menu?!</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Phew, thank goodness..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Eiichiro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> looked </STYLE><STYLE ID="8" RUBY="あんど">relieved</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Embarrassed, and still able to be this bold...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">Between what happened yesterday and this, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Eiichiro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> really does seem like someone I can rely on when it counts.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">My affection for </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Eiichiro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> grew bigger and bigger.</STYLE><PG>
