{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Kanai-sama</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, thank you for bringing </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">your companion</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> to us today. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Kanai-sama</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, we are truly grateful for your patronage ever since we opened. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">To your companion</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> as well, we humbly look forward to your continued patronage."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
