{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Mifuyu-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, you've been a regular here that long?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Huh? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　Yes, back when it had just opened, </STYLE>Akane<STYLE ID="1"> invited me..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">And I had a feeling the eyes around us were turned our way again.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">She</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">'s been a regular since it opened, they said."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">That girlfriend</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> must have a good eye, then."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Then the </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">boyfriend</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> must be someone amazing."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">It was a strange kind of praise, but if it made people think better of </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Eiichiro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, I didn't mind.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\コーヒーとクッキー.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">―The coffee they brought us kept that distinctive aroma, but its sweetness and creaminess matched perfectly, and even I found it delicious.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"This is delicious! Amazing, and coffee was always a total no for me before...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Eiichiro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, thanks to you, for the first time I could feel that coffee tastes good. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Thank you."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">I sent him a dreamy look.</STYLE><PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Haah... </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Eiichiro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Yes?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"............ </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">............ </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I like you..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
