<STYLE ID="2">Eiichiro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> sprayed his coffee everywhere.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">The next moment, I realized I had unconsciously said something outrageous.</STYLE><PG>
