<STYLE ID="2">"Cough! </STYLE>
{QUAKESTOP "500"}
{QUAKE "メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "5" "5" "0" "30"}
<STYLE ID="2">　Cough!"</STYLE>
{QUAKESTOP "500"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I-I-I-I'm sorry! I said something weird out of nowhere!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Both </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Eiichiro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> and I frantically wiped the table, but our hands kept fumbling and we couldn't clean it up properly.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"I-b-b-b-I, um...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I-I-I'm really sorry! Saying something so improper...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">By this point even the people around us were laughing in spite of themselves.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Maybe they're a good match in their own way?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Yeah... I'm starting to think so. Like, two of a kind?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">I heard talk like that, but I was desperately trying to get the situation under control.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">In the end we couldn't bear it anymore, so we hurried to drink our coffee and decided to leave the cafe.</STYLE>
