{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\夕焼け.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">We were more silent than we had ever been.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">I'd said something so improper that my face felt like it was on fire.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">The wind outside was as cold as ever.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">But the faint sunlight still lingering was gently warm.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">More than anything, because of the outrageous thing I'd said, my heart was racing and my whole body was burning hot.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Afraid </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Eiichiro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> might hear my heartbeat, I walked with my hand pressed to my chest.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Um... </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Mifuyu-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">The first to break the silence was </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Eiichiro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Are we... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">alike after all, do you think..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"We... are. I think so..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Laughing together when we laugh. Troubled together when we're troubled.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Embarrassed together when we're embarrassed.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"You might not like hearing this, but... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Mifuyu-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, when I look at you, it's like I'm looking at myself... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">I feel like I'm looking in a mirror."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">He said exactly what I had been thinking yesterday.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"So...! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Mifuyu-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, to make you smile, first I have to be smiling...! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　If you're ever sad, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Mifuyu-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, I'll smile! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　So...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Eiichiro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> turned toward me, his face redder than the sunset.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"So... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">please become a </STYLE><STYLE ID="10" RUBY="かりょく">family</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> with m-me!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"............!!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">It was a proposal I never would have imagined, the day after we first met.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Y... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
