<STYLE ID="1">　Please make me your family!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Normally, people would think a proposal the next day was absurd.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">But that's fine. It seems I really am extreme.</STYLE><PG>
