<STYLE ID="2">Eiichiro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">'s straight, earnest gaze was, to me, kind and warm beyond compare.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">You</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> are my mirror.</STYLE>
