<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Not the outside, but my very self, reflecting the heart.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Eiichiro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">... with him, I felt I could make the face reflected in that mirror shine forever.</STYLE>
